### Login (wrong password)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "anna",
  "password": "Wrong_password"
}

### Current user
GET http://localhost:3001/api/sessions/current

### Logout
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/sessions/current

### Network
GET http://localhost:3001/api/network

### Planning network
GET http://localhost:3001/api/network/planning

### Leaderboard
GET http://localhost:3001/api/leaderboard

### Start game
POST http://localhost:3001/api/games/start

### Submit game
POST http://localhost:3001/api/games/6/submit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "path": [20, 19, 9, 3]
}